fixture air_dash_lifts_onto_two_lips
doc an air dash level at y 192.19 in test/air_lift_two_lips lifts onto a 2 u lip and, 4 u on, meets a second lip 1 u higher on frame 20: it steps up that one too, as a walk would, and goes its whole 20 u (physics review 5, L1).
room test/air_lift_two_lips
spawn 93 304
frames 21
input
  0 -
  1 dash
  2 -
  3 -
  4 -
  5 -
  6 -
  7 dash
  8 jump
  9 jump
  10 jump
  11 jump dash
  12 jump
  13 jump !jump
  14 jump !jump
  15 jump
  16 jump
  17 jump dash
  18 jump
  19 R jump
  20 R
end
expect
  at 20 x>=20u+x@19
end
